WEBVTT

00:00.750 --> 00:03.340
<b>I'm quitting the band.</b>

00:05.800 --> 00:07.130
<b>Yuno-sa...</b>

00:08.130 --> 00:11.550
<b>Did she just say she's quitting?</b>

00:11.800 --> 00:13.970
<b>The band?! What? As in MewType?!</b>

00:14.100 --> 00:16.930
<b>So Yuno-san-chan's leaving
MewType?! Why?!</b>

00:17.060 --> 00:17.850
<b>I don't know.</b>

00:18.020 --> 00:20.560
<b>I'll try calling her.</b>

00:20.690 --> 00:22.610
<b>I'm calling manager-san now.</b>

00:22.770 --> 00:28.570
<b>Oh, come on!
I'm begging you, please pick up!</b>

00:28.990 --> 00:29.990
<b>You are offline</b>

00:30.110 --> 00:32.320
<b>Yuno-san-chan!
Please come back!</b>

00:48.880 --> 00:52.090
<b>Lyrics by koharu
Music by Yuno Sengoku</b>

00:53.800 --> 00:55.060
<b>Why...</b>

01:11.990 --> 01:16.540
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

01:17.700 --> 01:22.290
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

01:22.420 --> 01:26.880
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

01:27.380 --> 01:32.300
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

01:32.550 --> 01:37.350
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

01:37.600 --> 01:41.390
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

01:41.520 --> 01:48.070
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

01:48.230 --> 01:52.950
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

01:53.110 --> 01:57.910
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

01:58.080 --> 02:01.750
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

02:02.120 --> 02:07.500
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

02:07.630 --> 02:12.050
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

02:12.470 --> 02:16.930
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

02:17.050 --> 02:20.060
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

02:20.180 --> 02:23.480
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

02:23.640 --> 02:26.770
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

02:26.900 --> 02:28.320
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

02:28.610 --> 02:33.400
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

02:36.990 --> 02:40.040
<b>Yuno-san-chan!</b>

02:40.290 --> 02:42.870
<b>Where did you go?!</b>

02:43.000 --> 02:44.500
<b>She's not replying since yesterday.</b>

02:46.210 --> 02:47.670
<b>I wonder what happened.</b>

02:47.790 --> 02:49.840
<b>Hey, girls! Are you all here?</b>

02:49.960 --> 02:54.930
<b>Y... Yuno-chan-chan-san
said she's leaving MewType...</b>

02:55.050 --> 02:58.680
<b>I've heard what happened.
It's about Sengoku-san, right?</b>

03:00.100 --> 03:03.850
<b>Well, I'm sure she'll be back
in a couple of days.</b>

03:04.180 --> 03:07.100
<b>She's always been like that.</b>

03:07.440 --> 03:12.190
<b>Right now, we should just give her space
and wait, rather than push her.</b>

03:12.320 --> 03:13.780
<b>Really?</b>

03:13.900 --> 03:16.450
<b>"Take it slow and wait," again...</b>

03:16.570 --> 03:17.700
<b>That's how it is!</b>

03:18.030 --> 03:20.370
<b>So let's move on and try to reset...</b>

03:25.040 --> 03:29.420
<b>Well, I know it's not that simple,
but I do have some good news.</b>

03:30.460 --> 03:31.340
<b>Guess what!</b>

03:31.750 --> 03:35.170
<b>MewType has just landed
its very first collaboration!</b>

03:34.050 --> 03:35.170
<b>Congratulations</b>

03:35.800 --> 03:41.510
<b>You will be doing the next ending song
for the hit program "Sakidori Culture"!</b>

03:41.640 --> 03:42.680
<b>An ending song?</b>

03:42.890 --> 03:47.690
<b>You only got one show, but the backlash
ironically got you plenty of followers.</b>

03:47.810 --> 03:52.110
<b>We've definitely got the buzz!
Just turn them into real fans.</b>

03:52.480 --> 03:55.320
<b>That's the spirit we want! Got it?</b>

03:55.820 --> 03:57.990
<b>- Let's go!
- Yeah...</b>

03:58.110 --> 04:00.490
<b>- Go!
- Yeah!</b>

04:01.660 --> 04:03.120
<b>Excuse me...</b>

04:03.830 --> 04:06.040
<b>I have a deadline, so...</b>

04:06.410 --> 04:07.410
<b>I should go.</b>

04:07.540 --> 04:10.580
<b>- Okay, thanks.
- See you.</b>

04:11.130 --> 04:13.670
<b>All right. let's call it a day.</b>

04:12.540 --> 04:13.880
<b>Wait...</b>

04:13.800 --> 04:17.840
<b>I'll send you the details later,
so please review them.</b>

04:14.090 --> 04:16.550
<b>Take it slow and wait...</b>

04:21.340 --> 04:24.470
<b>Am I too shiny?</b>

04:25.020 --> 04:26.730
<b>Too smooth?</b>

04:28.020 --> 04:32.400
<b>What kinds of flowers
are blooming in the meadow?</b>

04:29.940 --> 04:32.480
<b>Usa Eater-chan</b>

04:34.520 --> 04:38.990
<b>So please, don't ever talk to me again.</b>

04:39.150 --> 04:42.280
<b>I... I hate you!</b>

04:46.910 --> 04:51.580
<b>Is hate the furthest thing from love?</b>

04:54.170 --> 04:55.380
<b>Yuno-chan</b>

04:56.130 --> 04:57.590
<b>Yuno-chan...</b>

04:59.340 --> 05:02.550
<b>Manager-san sent
the collaboration details.</b>

05:04.510 --> 05:08.350
<b>Lyrics by koharu
Music by Yuno Sengoku</b>

05:05.390 --> 05:08.140
<b>Was she in Yuno-chan's old band?</b>

05:22.700 --> 05:23.490
<b>Yuno-chan...</b>

05:24.200 --> 05:26.910
<b>I wonder why she left her band...</b>

05:27.410 --> 05:30.750
<b>Manager:
If the band is too much, you can just compose.</b>

05:31.160 --> 05:33.000
<b>I'm done with the band.</b>

05:33.670 --> 05:37.000
<b>So I can at least
keep working on writing songs.</b>

05:40.920 --> 05:42.380
<b>...image we once painted that day...</b>

05:42.550 --> 05:44.010
<b>Only fun dreams</b>

05:58.940 --> 06:02.150
<b>Nono-chan! Wake up!</b>

06:02.280 --> 06:04.070
<b>I'm up!</b>

06:10.870 --> 06:13.120
<b>SubYuno: This hurts</b>

06:11.790 --> 06:13.120
<b>Yuno-chan...</b>

06:13.580 --> 06:16.920
<b>She's turned into a mole.</b>

06:17.250 --> 06:22.090
<b>Shiroyama</b>

06:22.550 --> 06:24.880
<b>I've brought Miyako-san.</b>

06:26.010 --> 06:27.390
<b>Thanks, Ricchan.</b>

06:27.510 --> 06:30.600
<b>Now then,
about Yuno turning into a mole.</b>

06:30.720 --> 06:32.680
<b>- A what?
- That's right.</b>

06:32.890 --> 06:35.900
<b>- A big fat mole.
- She's been in the sun?</b>

06:36.020 --> 06:36.810
<b>No.</b>

06:37.060 --> 06:38.570
<b>Well, uh...</b>

06:38.900 --> 06:40.730
<b>Look at this!</b>

06:41.990 --> 06:44.200
<b>- What's this?
- As you all know...</b>

06:44.320 --> 06:47.070
<b>This is Yuno-chan's private account.</b>

06:47.620 --> 06:50.450
<b>"It hurts. It really hurts.
It hurts so much"?!</b>

06:50.790 --> 06:54.870
<b>Three "hurts" in a row?!
Isn't this a massive meltdown?!</b>

06:55.000 --> 06:58.210
<b>Yuno-chan's mentality is softer than tofu.</b>

06:58.790 --> 07:00.920
<b>Softer than the softest type, I heard.</b>

07:01.050 --> 07:02.670
<b>She just can't stop posting.</b>

07:02.800 --> 07:05.680
<b>Is this something that happens often?</b>

07:05.800 --> 07:09.970
<b>Yuno-chan turns into a big mole
once every few years.</b>

07:10.100 --> 07:13.560
<b>Is she a bit of a hassle? Wait...</b>

07:14.180 --> 07:16.100
<b>Nono-chan told me about her posts,</b>

07:16.350 --> 07:19.150
<b>and I got worried,
so I asked manager-san.</b>

07:19.270 --> 07:21.440
<b>Apparently, she ran away from home.</b>

07:21.610 --> 07:24.610
<b>Ran away?! You mean that she's gone?</b>

07:24.740 --> 07:27.240
<b>Her family knows about it, though.</b>

07:27.410 --> 07:29.990
<b>Wandering around aimlessly</b>

07:28.660 --> 07:29.990
<b>Yuno-san-chan...</b>

07:30.490 --> 07:33.700
<b>I wonder if she really wanted
to leave MewType.</b>

07:34.750 --> 07:35.750
<b>Wait, what?!</b>

07:35.910 --> 07:37.830
<b>Are we getting backlash again?!</b>

07:38.250 --> 07:40.380
<b>"MewType's fallout..."</b>

07:40.540 --> 07:41.840
<b>How'd this happen?!</b>

07:41.960 --> 07:44.010
<b>They must've seen Yuno-san's posts.</b>

07:44.340 --> 07:49.260
<b>Objection!
There's no way we're not getting along.</b>

07:47.340 --> 07:49.260
<b>Did they get into a fight?</b>

07:49.510 --> 07:50.800
<b>Not at all...</b>

07:52.100 --> 07:54.810
<b>Not one bit...</b>

07:54.970 --> 07:56.270
<b>It's my fault.</b>

07:56.810 --> 07:59.850
<b>In this situation,
anything can spark trouble.</b>

07:59.980 --> 08:04.480
<b>If I hadn't suggested the show,
none of this would've happened.</b>

08:04.690 --> 08:07.860
<b>No! The backlash isn't your fault!</b>

08:07.990 --> 08:10.410
<b>Personally, I'd say
none of it is your fault.</b>

08:10.740 --> 08:12.990
<b>"Personally, I'd say it's terrible."</b>

08:13.160 --> 08:16.870
<b>I would've suggested the show,
even if you hadn't!</b>

08:17.160 --> 08:18.750
<b>"Why is it so hard to understand?"</b>

08:18.920 --> 08:23.090
<b>So I don't want  you to think
that this is your fault!</b>

08:23.420 --> 08:25.670
<b>You agree, don't you?</b>

08:26.630 --> 08:28.800
<b>Arale-chan is right.
It's not your fault...</b>

08:28.930 --> 08:30.510
<b>Can we just stop already?</b>

08:31.300 --> 08:35.270
<b>Don't try to force everything
to go your way!</b>

08:35.560 --> 08:39.350
<b>You completely ignore what matters
and just gloss over it.</b>

08:39.560 --> 08:42.230
<b>- Miyako-san...
- You hit around the bush too much, it makes me sick!</b>

08:42.360 --> 08:44.270
<b>This doesn't make any sense!</b>

08:44.400 --> 08:48.320
<b>I said horrible things to Miyanaga-san,
and no one even mentions it!</b>

08:48.650 --> 08:50.820
<b>No one blames me!</b>

08:51.320 --> 08:52.660
<b>Then...</b>

08:53.620 --> 08:56.330
<b>what am I supposed to do?</b>

08:58.250 --> 08:59.660
<b>Miyako-san...</b>

09:01.120 --> 09:03.500
<b>Nono-chan, are you all right?</b>

09:04.380 --> 09:05.670
<b>I mean...</b>

09:06.170 --> 09:08.670
<b>I'm all right.</b>

09:20.640 --> 09:23.810
<b>I don't even know
what's right anymore...</b>

09:25.270 --> 09:29.820
<b>I just keep hating myself
more and more...</b>

09:42.750 --> 09:43.880
<b>Viola</b>

09:44.000 --> 09:45.340
<b>It's Miyako Fuji.</b>

09:50.170 --> 09:52.430
<b>Yuno-san isn't here either.</b>

09:53.430 --> 09:54.680
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

09:55.300 --> 10:00.140
<b>I cornered Miyako-san even though I knew
she was still in super-recovery mode.</b>

10:00.270 --> 10:04.980
<b>No, maybe she just didn't like
seeing everyone like that.</b>

10:05.730 --> 10:08.110
<b>Nono-chan's always so cheerful.</b>

10:16.740 --> 10:18.160
<b>Arale-chan...</b>

10:21.540 --> 10:22.790
<b>I got it!</b>

10:23.120 --> 10:27.540
<b>I want to talk more!
I want to know all about everyone!</b>

10:28.040 --> 10:33.590
<b>I had no idea what Yuno-san-chan likes
or where she could possibly go.</b>

10:33.720 --> 10:35.050
<b>That's why...</b>

10:40.310 --> 10:44.350
<b>"Body-Make & Pump-Up!"</b>

10:54.900 --> 10:56.450
<b>We can transform.</b>

10:57.450 --> 10:58.950
<b>That's right.</b>

11:01.200 --> 11:04.040
<b>I know MewType
can change for the better.</b>

11:05.290 --> 11:06.580
<b>Right!</b>

11:11.000 --> 11:16.590
<b>"We want everyone to keep dreaming.
That's why we're giving it our all."</b>

11:16.760 --> 11:18.890
<b>"A dream that never ends..."</b>

11:19.600 --> 11:20.510
<b>Or whatever.</b>

11:22.140 --> 11:24.730
<b>Your interview was the best, Viola.</b>

11:24.850 --> 11:26.520
<b>It was tough not to laugh.</b>

11:26.690 --> 11:31.110
<b>It's Miyako Fuji.
Can we have a parfait together again?</b>

11:27.310 --> 11:31.270
<b>By the way,
is it just going to be the three of us?</b>

11:31.400 --> 11:34.740
<b>MewType's not getting along, right?
Why don't we pull someone in?</b>

11:31.440 --> 11:34.030
<b>I'll be at the cafe after school.</b>

11:34.860 --> 11:37.780
<b>Sounds good! Let's swap someone in!</b>

11:38.070 --> 11:39.280
<b>I want Yuno.</b>

11:39.410 --> 11:41.450
<b>I want Usa Eater-chan!</b>

11:41.660 --> 11:43.700
<b>Then we'll swap her with you.</b>

11:46.330 --> 11:48.880
<b>- It was delicious.
- We'll come again.</b>

11:49.000 --> 11:51.000
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:06.060 --> 12:08.900
<b>All I do is sigh now.</b>

12:10.270 --> 12:13.690
<b>"Only pain truly knows
where the heart belongs."</b>

12:14.480 --> 12:16.860
<b>Uh, what's going on?</b>

12:16.990 --> 12:20.070
<b>It's Yuno-chan's heart poem.</b>

12:20.200 --> 12:21.240
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

12:21.370 --> 12:23.660
<b>It sounds like lyrics.</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:26.830
<b>"Girl with the bone-in meat"?</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:26.830
<b>Missing</b>

12:26.960 --> 12:28.460
<b>It's Yuno-san-chan!</b>

12:28.670 --> 12:32.920
<b>A portrait is best for finding someone,
so I had Ricchan draw it.</b>

12:33.040 --> 12:35.510
<b>We wanted to ask Miyako-san,</b>

12:36.090 --> 12:38.010
<b>but we can't reach her at all.</b>

12:38.470 --> 12:40.800
<b>She hasn't come to school either.</b>

12:42.260 --> 12:47.100
<b>All right! Now that the portrait's done,
let's go look for Yuno-san-chan!</b>

12:47.230 --> 12:50.940
<b>Nono-chan-san, please patrol
your assigned area too!</b>

12:51.060 --> 12:52.860
<b>Let's go!</b>

13:05.160 --> 13:06.490
<b>Yuno-san?</b>

13:07.200 --> 13:10.120
<b>Yuno-san-chan... so, a DJ...</b>

13:10.370 --> 13:12.420
<b>A DJ, so a club...</b>

13:12.540 --> 13:15.170
<b>- Are you serious?
- Why not?</b>

13:19.720 --> 13:21.510
<b>No I hate this
I hate this</b>

13:21.630 --> 13:23.550
<b>It hurts too much...
Feeling sorry? That's right</b>

13:23.850 --> 13:26.680
<b>She's going deeper underground.</b>

13:26.930 --> 13:28.930
<b>Have you seen someone like her?</b>

13:30.520 --> 13:34.560
<b>She's like chicken salad
with light toppings, something mild.</b>

13:34.690 --> 13:36.690
<b>I don't know.</b>

13:36.820 --> 13:41.900
<b>Here's your chicken with teriyaki sauce
and a mountain of toppings.</b>

13:42.030 --> 13:43.700
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:46.950 --> 13:50.330
<b>I wonder what Yuno-san usually eats.</b>

13:55.920 --> 13:57.050
<b>Miyako-san.</b>

13:57.460 --> 13:59.260
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

14:00.340 --> 14:02.550
<b>Are you meeting Viola?</b>

14:03.930 --> 14:07.180
<b>No, you can't! Wait!</b>

14:07.890 --> 14:10.770
<b>Excuse me... I'm looking for this human.</b>

14:14.150 --> 14:15.150
<b>Ricchan?</b>

14:15.270 --> 14:17.400
<b>I'm chasing Miyako-san right now.</b>

14:17.520 --> 14:18.650
<b>Miyako-san?!</b>

14:18.820 --> 14:23.200
<b>- She should still be nearby.
- I'll go help you.</b>

14:23.360 --> 14:25.490
<b>No, I'll handle it.</b>

14:25.620 --> 14:27.830
<b>I'll talk to her about Viola.</b>

14:28.160 --> 14:29.620
<b>Ricchan...</b>

14:29.990 --> 14:31.410
<b>I'll leave it to you!</b>

14:31.540 --> 14:33.120
<b>I'll take care of it!</b>

14:41.260 --> 14:45.260
<b>She caught me.
MewType's in trouble, and here I am...</b>

14:45.390 --> 14:47.680
<b>- It's Fairy!
- They're so cute!</b>

14:47.850 --> 14:50.060
<b>Fairy Bouquet</b>

14:54.940 --> 14:55.940
<b>I miss you.</b>

14:56.900 --> 14:59.570
<b>I want to see you, Viola-san.</b>

14:59.690 --> 15:00.940
<b>Miyako-san.</b>

15:03.900 --> 15:06.740
<b>I said your name.</b>

15:13.540 --> 15:15.870
<b>Seasonal Strawberry Parfait</b>

15:16.040 --> 15:20.840
<b>So, this is the menu.
You already know that. Sorry...</b>

15:21.000 --> 15:24.800
<b>It's on me,
so please order whatever you like.</b>

15:21.000 --> 15:23.630
<b>Popo: She's here
Viola: Found her, thanks</b>

15:24.920 --> 15:27.720
<b>Thanks, but why?</b>

15:27.840 --> 15:29.100
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

15:29.510 --> 15:33.140
<b>I designed Minetsuki-san's avatar
without knowing anything,</b>

15:33.270 --> 15:37.150
<b>and it ended up upsetting you
and all the Fairy fans.</b>

15:37.810 --> 15:42.610
<b>I still sent you a message
saying I wanted to see you again...</b>

15:42.730 --> 15:45.320
<b>You looked me up?</b>

15:46.450 --> 15:47.740
<b>Yes...</b>

15:48.110 --> 15:49.570
<b>That's scary.</b>

15:49.820 --> 15:51.530
<b>Did she figure it out?</b>

15:49.820 --> 15:53.540
<b>Viola dating - Viola address
Viola hobbies - Viola school</b>

15:51.660 --> 15:55.960
<b>People are spreading
all kinds of things online.</b>

15:56.080 --> 15:59.460
<b>I'm scared of what
you might think of me.</b>

15:59.580 --> 16:04.590
<b>What are you talking about?!
I watched all of your videos!</b>

16:04.710 --> 16:08.180
<b>They were all amazing!
That's real entertainment!</b>

16:08.300 --> 16:09.550
<b>A true pro!</b>

16:10.140 --> 16:15.220
<b>I was genuinely moved by how much
you put your fans first!</b>

16:15.350 --> 16:20.150
<b>Each member's character and how
they interact is really incredible.</b>

16:21.020 --> 16:24.150
<b>Sorry, I got carried away...</b>

16:26.070 --> 16:28.200
<b>I'm glad you get me.</b>

16:29.160 --> 16:29.950
<b>But...</b>

16:30.410 --> 16:34.370
<b>it's not like everyone understands.</b>

16:34.490 --> 16:37.250
<b>Some people reject me,
or even despise me.</b>

16:37.370 --> 16:40.120
<b>I saw Arale-san's video.</b>

16:40.250 --> 16:42.210
<b>I thought it was awful.</b>

16:42.590 --> 16:43.840
<b>Really?</b>

16:44.000 --> 16:47.720
<b>No wonder no one could speak up.</b>

16:47.840 --> 16:48.630
<b>Why?</b>

16:48.880 --> 16:51.140
<b>She's way too intense!</b>

16:51.840 --> 16:55.600
<b>I know she's driven
and puts her heart into everything,</b>

16:55.970 --> 16:58.640
<b>but she's so overwhelming, it's scary!</b>

16:58.770 --> 17:01.150
<b>She doesn't notice anyone else!</b>

17:01.270 --> 17:03.060
<b>She just talks and talks,</b>

17:03.190 --> 17:06.530
<b>ignoring everyone,
completely satisfied on her own!</b>

17:06.690 --> 17:07.690
<b>She's selfish!</b>

17:08.240 --> 17:11.610
<b>Totally self-centered!
Honestly, Arale-san is...</b>

17:11.780 --> 17:13.280
<b>Arale-san is...</b>

17:16.370 --> 17:18.370
<b>Uh... What did I...</b>

17:19.000 --> 17:22.250
<b>We will meet again, right?</b>

17:23.790 --> 17:25.000
<b>Yes.</b>

17:33.550 --> 17:38.520
<b>Did I end up saying something
I didn't even mean?</b>

17:39.730 --> 17:44.480
<b>I was just venting...
It was nothing serious, right?</b>

17:48.440 --> 17:49.530
<b>Minetsuki-san...</b>

17:49.900 --> 17:51.240
<b>Why are you here?</b>

17:51.360 --> 17:53.660
<b>I'm sorry! I was following you.</b>

17:54.450 --> 17:57.410
<b>I saw you and Viola,
so I waited outside.</b>

17:58.790 --> 18:01.000
<b>Could you read this for me?</b>

18:02.040 --> 18:05.040
<b>I wasn't sure if I could
explain it out loud,</b>

18:05.210 --> 18:07.800
<b>but I really want you to understand.</b>

18:11.090 --> 18:14.680
<b>Viola
Breaking Free from the Victim's Mind</b>

18:12.590 --> 18:14.010
<b>What is this?</b>

18:17.850 --> 18:20.180
<b>Thank you for reading</b>

18:20.810 --> 18:25.230
<b>I didn't mean to make it this thick.
Sorry if it was hard to read.</b>

18:25.350 --> 18:27.650
<b>No, it was impressive.</b>

18:27.770 --> 18:30.780
<b>This could even be turned
into your own manga.</b>

18:31.110 --> 18:32.820
<b>Oh, thank you.</b>

18:33.320 --> 18:36.070
<b>I understand what you're trying to say.</b>

18:36.200 --> 18:41.910
<b>You and Arale-san don't
see Viola-san the same way I do.</b>

18:43.000 --> 18:43.790
<b>But...</b>

18:44.370 --> 18:48.130
<b>I could really feel
that she understood me.</b>

18:48.380 --> 18:52.510
<b>Thanks to her,
I started believing in myself.</b>

18:54.130 --> 18:58.300
<b>So without her, I...</b>

18:59.390 --> 19:04.480
<b>I see... so you and I are like
a wiener and a sausage.</b>

19:05.980 --> 19:09.860
<b>Different, but kind of the same.
Like ohagi and botamochi sweets.</b>

19:07.650 --> 19:09.860
<b>Chunky red bean paste
Smooth red bean paste</b>

19:09.980 --> 19:13.690
<b>Aren't they practically the same?</b>

19:15.450 --> 19:20.490
<b>I always thought
I was too serious, quiet, and boring...</b>

19:20.620 --> 19:22.830
<b>that I was missing a sense of self.</b>

19:23.580 --> 19:27.170
<b>But Viola opened a path for me.</b>

19:28.210 --> 19:30.460
<b>I became the model student, Clematis.</b>

19:31.170 --> 19:35.260
<b>Once I trusted Viola
and started following her words,</b>

19:35.380 --> 19:38.260
<b>the answers were always
right in front of me.</b>

19:38.590 --> 19:40.010
<b>It was so easy.</b>

19:40.300 --> 19:44.600
<b>At first, I believed it was a path
I had carved out myself,</b>

19:44.930 --> 19:47.230
<b>that it was the only path for me.</b>

19:48.270 --> 19:52.780
<b>But even that thought
was exactly what Viola wanted.</b>

19:54.900 --> 19:59.450
<b>Even so, if people around you expect it,
isn't that fine?</b>

19:59.570 --> 20:05.120
<b>I've been living like that all my life,
so I can survive in the world I chose.</b>

20:06.040 --> 20:09.290
<b>I became completely empty.</b>

20:09.830 --> 20:12.090
<b>I swallowed
too many of her right answers</b>

20:12.670 --> 20:15.710
<b>and lost sight of what I like,
what I want to do,</b>

20:15.880 --> 20:19.260
<b>and what truly matters to me.</b>

20:19.840 --> 20:24.890
<b>And Viola kept stuffing me with words
that were sweeter than the last.</b>

20:25.350 --> 20:27.520
<b>I've always wanted to meet you.</b>

20:27.690 --> 20:29.270
<b>I immediately fell in love.</b>

20:29.440 --> 20:33.570
<b>"If this meeting is fate,
I hope it continues."</b>

20:33.770 --> 20:36.860
<b>They're sparkling. It's beautiful.</b>

20:37.610 --> 20:39.820
<b>My grandma always told me,</b>

20:39.990 --> 20:43.830
<b>"Eating too many sweets
isn't good for your health."</b>

20:44.830 --> 20:48.410
<b>What's scary is that
she never gets her own hands dirty.</b>

20:49.000 --> 20:52.210
<b>She charms people
and makes others take the blame.</b>

20:52.330 --> 20:56.670
<b>I understand what you're saying.
I really do, but...</b>

20:58.220 --> 20:59.630
<b>Can't we talk?</b>

21:00.220 --> 21:04.010
<b>I think we should talk more.</b>

21:04.140 --> 21:07.930
<b>Like what kind of meat you like,
how you like it cooked...</b>

21:08.230 --> 21:10.520
<b>I'm only repeating Arale-chan.</b>

21:11.730 --> 21:15.320
<b>But I think Nono-chan
feels the same way.</b>

21:16.230 --> 21:18.440
<b>We want to understand you.</b>

21:18.940 --> 21:20.910
<b>- Stop seeing Viola...
- I'm sorry!</b>

21:21.490 --> 21:23.910
<b>I'm sorry, I...</b>

21:24.450 --> 21:25.990
<b>Miyako-san!</b>

21:36.840 --> 21:38.510
<b>I don't understand.</b>

21:41.550 --> 21:43.890
<b>Viola:
Don't you think we're meant to be?</b>

21:46.680 --> 21:48.680
<b>I don't want to understand.</b>

21:51.060 --> 21:52.480
<b>Viola-san...</b>

21:55.980 --> 22:03.700
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.820 --> 22:07.620
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.740 --> 22:15.460
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.760 --> 22:27.300
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.430 --> 22:34.770
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.770 --> 22:42.820
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.650 --> 22:51.830
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:53.040 --> 23:00.710
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.880 --> 23:04.680
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.800 --> 23:11.770
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.680 --> 23:19.440
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:27.070 --> 23:30.120
<b>You're just like a hectopascal.</b>

23:30.330 --> 23:35.500
<b>You sweep through my heart
like a sudden typhoon.</b>

23:35.910 --> 23:39.500
<b>West to east,
the left ventricle to the right atrium.</b>

23:37.920 --> 23:39.880
<b>Sea</b>
